	"d": {
		"396268": ["**#01**\n\nOn the road leading to the city, along the fence.", []],
		"396269": [
			"When you enter Stairway to the Sky during the DLC, there with be an encounter where one of the Heartless has a pink glow. Enemies will spawn infinitely until this special Heartless is defeated.\n\nDestroy the glowing Heartless to release the first piece of Kairi's heart.",
			[
				{
					"id": 56195,
					"title": "KH3ReMind_HeartPiece1",
					"file_name": "114cf8f9-c3d7-4490-a47e-d9dbc860be4a.png",
					"attribution": "",
					"url": "https://media.mapgenie.io/storage/media/114cf8f9-c3d7-4490-a47e-d9dbc860be4a.png",
					"type": "image",
					"mime_type": "image/png",
					"meta": null,
					"order": 10,
					"spoiler": false
				}
			]
		],
		"396270": [
			"Attack the crank wheel outside the cell to open the gate. Inside the cell, you can see the Heart Piece trapped in a cage. Turn around towards the gate and wall-run up the tower above the gate. At the top, there will be a metal platform; jump down and hit the \"Attack!\" Command when it appears mid-fall.",
			[
				{
					"id": 56199,
					"title": "KH3ReMind_HeartPiece3",
					"file_name": "655cb7b6-c446-4fbb-844e-42c3e60f006c.png",
					"attribution": "",
					"url": "https://media.mapgenie.io/storage/media/655cb7b6-c446-4fbb-844e-42c3e60f006c.png",
					"type": "image",
					"mime_type": "image/png",
					"meta": null,
					"order": 10,
					"spoiler": false
				}
			]
		],
		"396271": [
			"The fifth and final Heart Piece. Only revealed after all other Heart Pieces are found.\n\nApproach the center of the emblem and defeat the giant Heartless that appears.",
			[
				{
					"id": 56198,
					"title": "KH3ReMind_HeartPiece5",
					"file_name": "bb37b1c6-98e4-4e72-bff1-2d089d5e4531.png",
					"attribution": "",
					"url": "https://media.mapgenie.io/storage/media/bb37b1c6-98e4-4e72-bff1-2d089d5e4531.png",
					"type": "image",
					"mime_type": "image/png",
					"meta": null,
					"order": 10,
					"spoiler": false
				}
			]
		],
		"396272": [
			"Quickly cast Aero on all four windmills surrounding the empty fountain, so all the fountain spouts are on at the same time. Defeat the enemies that appear.",
			[
				{
					"id": 56197,
					"title": "KH3ReMind_HeartPiece2",
					"file_name": "e9b00253-9753-46f3-bffb-af0b4ef43631.png",
					"attribution": "",
					"url": "https://media.mapgenie.io/storage/media/e9b00253-9753-46f3-bffb-af0b4ef43631.png",
					"type": "image",
					"mime_type": "image/png",
					"meta": null,
					"order": 10,
					"spoiler": false
				}
			]
		],
		"396273": [
			"This is a timing and color-match puzzle. \n\nStand on the colored circles to make the rings on the globe move. When the gem color aligns with the colored spot on the globe, hit the gem pedestal. If you mess up, hit the pedestal again for the rings to resume moving.\n\nWhen all three rings are lined up with the globe, the Heart Piece will be revealed.",
			[
				{
					"id": 56196,
					"title": "KH3ReMind_HeartPiece4",
					"file_name": "4f945cea-7a6f-4f9c-9716-ef9d4a739421.png",
					"attribution": "",
					"url": "https://media.mapgenie.io/storage/media/4f945cea-7a6f-4f9c-9716-ef9d4a739421.png",
					"type": "image",
					"mime_type": "image/png",
					"meta": null,
					"order": 10,
					"spoiler": false
				}
			]
		],
